WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
Can brackets go inside brackets?

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.190
Yes.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.450
Work from the innermost pair outwards.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.440
2 × (3 + (4 − 1))

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.890
4 − 1 is 3.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.020
3 + 3 is 6.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.013
6 × 2 is 12.
